  },
  {
    "id": 7006001010010,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "うん、そうだと思っていたよ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700600101/7006001010010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（ん？　嬉しそうではあるが\r\nあまり驚いてないな……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだと思っていた、か\r\n自信があったんだな？",
    "charAnim2": "yes",
    "charAnim2Loop": false,
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7006001010020,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "私なりに手応えはあったよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700600101/7006001010020"
  },
  {
    "id": 7006001010030,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "審査を通過できるだろうと\r\n自信を持って思える程度にはね",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700600101/7006001010030"
  },
  {
    "id": 7006001010040,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "そう思えたのは、\r\nプロデューサーがいてくれたおかげかな",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700600101/7006001010040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺が？",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7006001010050,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "写真撮影の時にも\r\nアドバイスをしてくれたからね",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charAnim2Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700600101/7006001010050"
  },
  {
    "id": 7006001010060,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "あの時はおかげでいい撮影ができたよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700600101/7006001010060"
  },
  {
    "id": 7006001010070,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "プロデューサーがサポートしてくれたおかげで\r\n私は自分の力を引き出せたんだ",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700600101/7006001010070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうなのか。俺はプロデューサーとして\r\n咲耶の力になれているなら嬉しいよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7006001010080,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "うん、いつも力になってくれてる",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700600101/7006001010080"
  },
  {
    "id": 7006001010090,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "まだまだ先は長い\r\nこれからもサポートをお願いするよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700600101/7006001010090"
  },
  {
    "id": 7006001010100,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "それで、もっと多くの人を笑顔にしよう",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700600101/7006001010100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "その意気だ\r\nこの調子で、ふたりでがんばろうな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7006001010110,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ああ\r\nみんなに笑顔を届けていこう",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700600101/7006001010110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "その様子なら安心だ\r\n期待しているぞ、咲耶",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7006001010120,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "プロデューサーの期待か\r\nぜひとも応えたいね",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700600101/7006001010120"
  },
  {
    "id": 7006001010130,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "それじゃあ\r\nさっそく次を目指してレッスンするよ",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
